IRE) -- SYSCO CORPORATION (NYSE:SYY), THE LEADING GLOBAL FOODSERVICE DISTRIBUTION COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAD REDUCED ITS OUTSTANDING DEBT BY A TOTAL OF $1.1 BILLION.'}{'symbol': 'TMUS', 'date': '2021-03-11 18:01:00-04:56', 'title': 'T-Mobile Further Solidifies 5G Leadership Position with Successful C-Band Auction', 'text': "BELLEVUE, WASH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--$45 BILLION CAN BUY A LOT OF THINGS, BUT 5G LEADERSHIP AIN'T ONE. T-MOBILE (NASDAQ: TMUS) INVESTED JUST OVER $9.3 BILLION IN THE FCC'S C-BAND AUCTION, SELECTIVELY ACQUIRING ADDITIONAL MID-BAND SPECTRUM IT WILL USE TO TAKE AMERICA'S LARGEST AND FASTEST 5G NETWORK TO THE NEXT LEVEL AND CONTINUE DELIVERING MASSIVE CUSTOMER BENEFITS UNLOCKED BY THE MERGER WITH SPRINT. EVEN AS ITS COMPETITORS SPENT RECORD-BREAKING AMOUNTS IN THE AUCTION, T-MOBILE MAINTAINS ITS LEADE"}{'symbol': 'TPR', 'date': '2021-03-11 09:51:00-04:56', 'title': "INVESTOR ALERT: Scott+Scott Attorneys at Law LLP Continues to Investigate Tapestry, Inc.'s Directors and Officers for Breach of Fiduciary Duties – TPR", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #TPR--INVESTOR ALERT: SCOTT+SCOTT ATTORNEYS AT LAW LLP CONTINUES TO INVESTIGATE TAPESTRY, INC.'S DIRECTORS AND OFFICERS FOR BREACH OF FIDUCIARY DUTIES – TPR"}{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2021-03-11 13:45:00-04:56', 'title': 'On heels of C-Band results, Verizon expands 5G Home Internet to 10 more cities', 'text': "STRONG SPECTRUM HOLDINGS WILL FUEL VERIZON'S RAPID 5G MOBILITY AND HOME EXPANSION IN 2021 AND BEYOND; THIS IS 5G BUILT RIGHT STRONG SPECTRUM HOLDINGS WILL FUEL VERIZON'S RAPID 5G MOBILITY AND HOME EXPANSION IN 2021 AND BEYOND; THIS IS 5G BUILT RIGHT"}{'symbol': 'ZTS', 'date': '2021-03-11 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Zoetis Launches “Driven to Care” Sustainability Initiative and Long-Term Goals to Meet Commitments to Communities, Animals and the Planet', 'text': 'PARSIPPANY, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $ZTS #DRIVENTOCARE--ZOETIS TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS LONG-TERM SUSTAINABILITY GOALS.'}